  "title": "Quenched Norwegian Almond Ceviche",
  "description": "A citrusy, aerated midnight snack that fuses smoked tofu with toasted almond essence for a chilled, Jain-friendly twist on classic ceviche.",
  "cuisine": "norwegian",
