  "instructions": [
    "Slice smoked tofu into 1/2-inch cubes.",
    "In a bowl combine lime juice, lemon juice, toasted almond extract, smoked sea salt, and chili flakes.",
    "Add the tofu cubes to the citrus mixture and gently stir to coat.",
    "Fold in diced cucumber, diced red bell pepper, capers, and fresh dill.",
    "Drizzle olive oil over the mixture and toss lightly.",
    "Sprinkle chopped fresh mint leaves on top.",
    "Cover the bowl and refrigerate for 5 minutes to allow flavors to mingle.",
    "Give the ceviche a final gentle stir before serving.",
    "Plate the chilled ceviche into small bowls or on crisp lettuce leaves.",
    "Garnish with extra mint and a light dusting of smoked sea salt if desired."
  ],
